Z||000015||frontal lobe||07-16-2001||06:54 PM||||That is terrific, Jimmy.  Congratulations.  Have a great time with it.<P>You must not have spent a lot on the engine if you came in around 4 thousand.  Are you using a carbureted engine or fuel-injected?And what exhaust did you go with, catalytic converters or mufflers?  How loud is it?  And what rpm are you running at say 70 and 80 mph?||||reg||1
